+RSYS_30=of a maximum of %1
+RSYS_31=Hardware acceleration
+RSYS_32=Flow Cache
+RSYS_33=Wireless clients
+RSYS_34=Associated
+RSYS_35=Authorised
+RSYS_36=Authenticated
+RSYS_37=The feature flags this firmware was built with. They decide which pages and options exist at all, which is why a setting someone else has may simply be absent here.
+RSYS_38=Not available
+RSYS_39=Hardware
+RSYS_40=IP address
+RSYS_41=headroom
